  "description": "eID Mongolia client-side PAdES for .NET (PDF never leaves the client): Prepare → citizen signs the 32-byte DTBS on phone/token → CompleteAsync (RFC 3161 TSA, OCSP/CRL, DSS). Native C# port of the Go reference, byte-identical output. Also: «My QR» RP client (GeregeSystems.EidMongolia.Qr) — the citizen's «My info», PIN2-signed PS256 JWS (x5c, qualified cert) verified offline + OCSP.",
